OL,3,GNEWSASevere weather threat renews
OL,4,Atown's flood concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage building which partially
OL,7,Fcollapsed into a river three years ago
OL,8,Fis at greater risk of further giving
OL,9,Fway due to severe weather forecast as
OL,10,Fpart of the El Nino climate pattern, it
OL,11,Fhas been warned.
OL,13,FPart of the Old Courthouse in
OL,14,FCockermouth, Cumbria, fell into the
OL,15,FRiver Cocker in October 2023, sparking
OL,16,Ffears about its impact on flood
OL,17,Fdefences in a town which saw major
OL,18,Fflooding in 2009 and 2015.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
