OL,3,GNEWSASevere weather threat renews
OL,4,Atown's flood concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) confirmed
OL,7,Fit had put temporary defences in place
OL,8,Fbut Cumberland Council said it was down
OL,9,Fto the owner to stabilise the building.
OL,11,FThe private landlord said the EA and
OL,12,Fthe council had failed to act on "known
OL,13,Fstructural and flood risk issues" and
OL,14,Frejected responsibility.
